  "summary": "Malicious code in 7bit-casino (npm)",
  "details": "7bit-casino@1.0.0 is an SEO-spam package: its only code file (index.js) is an empty module, and its README is promotional content for the 7Bit Casino online gambling site, embedding affiliate links to 7bit[.]casinologin[.]mobi and 7bitcasino[.]com and an image hosted at i[.]ibb[.]co. The package ships no functional library and exists to drive traffic to the casino affiliate destination.",
